 * 2. Hero Image & Practice Areas Menu:
 *    - Unclipped showcase frame with object-contain and aspect-[2752/1536].
 *    - 5 Other Practice Areas (current practice excluded).
 *    - Hover state inherits the selected bluish pill style: deep blue gradient with white text.
