 *    - Direct HubSpot "Book a Meeting" button.
 *    - 4 Center-aligned square cards highlighting Recruitment Capabilities.
 * 4. Section 2 ("Our Expertise"):
 *    - 3 Cards with Prism Spotlight Stage animation (Security-Cleared Recruitment, Custom Talent Solutions, Federal Hiring).
 * 5. Section 3 ("Who We Serve"):
 *    - Dual-audience split architecture: Small & Medium Businesses (SMBs) vs Government Contractors (GC).
 * 6. Section 4 ("How We Support Our Clients"):
 *    - Segmented comparative support frameworks for SMBs and Government Contractors.
 * 7. Section 5 ("Agencies We've Successfully Recruited For"):
 *    - Grid showcase of the 7 federal departments (DoD, DHS, NASA, DOE, DOJ, DOS, DOC) with official seals.
 * 8. Section 6 ("Ready to Secure Your Cleared Workforce?"):
